ShallowFrontier
=============

Based on InstructDiff: Domain-Adaptive Data Selection via Differential
Entropy for Efficient LLM Fine-Tuning
https://github.com/zhuchichi56/Instruct-diff

ShallowFrontier contributes prefix-limited scoring, asymmetric ΔH
extrapolation, K128/K256 configurations, evaluation and energy analysis.

